WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.459 --> 00:00:05.459
Tell me why do you say you are a painter

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:11.189
Because I love painting I have to paint. I've always been a painter that I know

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
a born painter

00:00:15.879 --> 00:00:17.879
Yes

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.980
how do you know

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.770
Because I can't do anything else, an believe me I've tried

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.929
I think myself as an exile

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.180
You're Vincent, Theo's brother? yes , brother. I'm Paul Gauguin

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:43.040
You have to start a revolution. Do you understand? We have to create a new vision a new way of painting

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:48.509
I spent all my life alone in a room. I'd like to find a new light

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.419
for paintings that we haven't yet seen

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.899
There's something inside me, I don't know what it is

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.960
What I see nobody else sees

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:05.840
You're stranger here. You drink too much you'er hysterical and go out of control. I don't want to calm down

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:08.270
It's called the act painting for a reason

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:09.230
LEAVE ME ALONE

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:10.270
GO AWAY

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:18.709
Don't you see that this painting is unpleasant your townspeople has signed a petition against you they don't want you to come back

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:23.900
I can't stay here Vincent. You're surrounded by stupid wicked ignorant people

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:32.320
So that's the reason why you got off your ear, your vision of the world is quite frightening, isn't it? Yes

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:39.109
Sometimes I feel so far away from everything I think I'm losing my mind

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:48.090
Sometimes they say I'm mad but a grain of madness is the best of art

00:01:53.409 --> 00:01:59.258
Can you believe that God gave you the gift of painting to keep you in misery? I never thought about it that way

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.989
Maybe God made me a painter for people who aren't born yet

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:10.809
Tell me brother am I a good painter? Not a good painter Vincent. You're a great painter

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.429
I wanted so much to share what I see

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:19.279
Now I just think about my relationship to eternity

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.990
You

